# Bare `gruntas` prints the overview whether or not a person is at a terminal;
# on a terminal it is the same page, and the flags that once opened the
# agent's screen are refused with a hint to use `-p`. Piped, bare `gruntas`
# prints the overview rather than the catalog, which takes --json.
gruntas
gruntas --json
gruntas --format human
@stdin hello\n
gruntas
@tty gruntas
@tty gruntas --json
@tty gruntas --resume
@tty gruntas --model claude-x
